      "statement": "open_pull_request intentionally attributes a PR through its resolved author credential: _resolve_pr_author_token prefers a fresh OAuth token for the triggering mapped user on Slack, Linear, and dashboard runs, but falls back to the GitHub App installation token for GitHub-triggered runs, unmapped or unavailable users, and bot-only deployments.",
      "evidence": [
